"""The window's strings for what a store's terms make of whole-book mode: the note under the start dialog's question
whether to read the whole book first and above the whole-book dialog's Start (`ui.dialogs.start.terms_note`). It says
what TASlation does and leaves the question of a store's terms open: nothing here promises that a use is allowed."""

